{
    "title": "Safe Surfer: Block Porn & Apps",
    "description": "Built to be simple to use, protecting your device with Safe Surfer is as easy as tapping the Get Protected button.\r\n\r\nSafe Surfer is packed full of features to enable you and your family to surf the Internet without fear:\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Safer Surfing\r\nSafe Surfer blocks a wide range of pornographic and adult websites. Once protection is enabled, these websites cannot load on your device.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Eliminate Distractions\r\nSign in to enable blocking 50+ more popular apps and games.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Remote Control (Pro)\r\nUse the web dashboard to remotely block sites and view the device's browsing history.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Mail Alerts (Pro)\r\nRegularly send blocked sites and screen blackout events to an admin or accountability partner.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Internet History (Pro)\r\nView detailed browsing history stats on the device or remotely.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Pin Protection\r\nBuilt-in pin lock functionality ensures that only you or an accountability partner can configure protection and other settings inside the app.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Prevent Uninstall\r\nWith a PIN code, prevent uninstalling or disabling the app without permission from the admin. Requires enabling the Accessibility Service using the checkbox under \"enable always-on\".\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Screen Blackout\r\nPowered by machine learning, Screencast detection is a new way to deter the viewing of inappropriate content. When Screen blackout is enabled and triggered, a screenshot is taken and stored securely, along with the screen being temporarily blacked out.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Wi-Fi and Cellular protection\r\nSafe Surfer protection keeps your device protected\u2014no matter what kind of network you are connected to.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Zero ads and low resource footprint\r\nSafe Surfer is ad-free and has a minimal impact on your device's resources.\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\r\n\u2022 As a monitoring app, Safe Surfer must be installed by the legal owner and/or custodian of this device solely for personal usage, monitoring a child for which you are a legal guardian, or monitoring employee usage on a device owned by an organization. Using Safe Surfer for other/malicious purposes is stricly prohibited. A persistent notification shows at all times when Safe Surfer is active.\r\n\r\n\u2022 As a parental control app, we use the Android AccessibilityService API for the sole purpose of stopping device users from uninstalling protection without the permission of a parent (or an accountability partner).\r\n\r\n\u2022 As a parental control app, we use the Android VPNService API to filter online content according to your settings. This VPN does not change your IP address/country on the internet, nor does it affect your internet speed. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Some mobile service providers and Internet service providers in certain countries hijack the ability to use specific DNS settings. The Safe Surfer app relies upon this ability. If this is the case in your country with your service provider, the Safe Surfer app may not work properly on your device.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Built to be simple to use, protecting your device with Safe Surfer is as easy as tapping the Get Protected button.<br><br>Safe Surfer is packed full of features to enable you and your family to surf the Internet without fear:<br><br>\u27a4 Safer Surfing<br>Safe Surfer blocks a wide range of pornographic and adult websites. Once protection is enabled, these websites cannot load on your device.<br><br>\u27a4 Eliminate Distractions<br>Sign in to enable blocking 50+ more popular apps and games.<br><br>\u27a4 Remote Control (Pro)<br>Use the web dashboard to remotely block sites and view the device&#39;s browsing history.<br><br>\u27a4 Mail Alerts (Pro)<br>Regularly send blocked sites and screen blackout events to an admin or accountability partner.<br><br>\u27a4 Internet History (Pro)<br>View detailed browsing history stats on the device or remotely.<br><br>\u27a4 Pin Protection<br>Built-in pin lock functionality ensures that only you or an accountability partner can configure protection and other settings inside the app.<br><br>\u27a4 Prevent Uninstall<br>With a PIN code, prevent uninstalling or disabling the app without permission from the admin. Requires enabling the Accessibility Service using the checkbox under &quot;enable always-on&quot;.<br><br>\u27a4 Screen Blackout<br>Powered by machine learning, Screencast detection is a new way to deter the viewing of inappropriate content. When Screen blackout is enabled and triggered, a screenshot is taken and stored securely, along with the screen being temporarily blacked out.<br><br>\u27a4 Wi-Fi and Cellular protection<br>Safe Surfer protection keeps your device protected\u2014no matter what kind of network you are connected to.<br><br>\u27a4 Zero ads and low resource footprint<br>Safe Surfer is ad-free and has a minimal impact on your device&#39;s resources.<br><br>Notes:<br><br>\u2022 As a monitoring app, Safe Surfer must be installed by the legal owner and/or custodian of this device solely for personal usage, monitoring a child for which you are a legal guardian, or monitoring employee usage on a device owned by an organization. Using Safe Surfer for other/malicious purposes is stricly prohibited. A persistent notification shows at all times when Safe Surfer is active.<br><br>\u2022 As a parental control app, we use the Android AccessibilityService API for the sole purpose of stopping device users from uninstalling protection without the permission of a parent (or an accountability partner).<br><br>\u2022 As a parental control app, we use the Android VPNService API to filter online content according to your settings. This VPN does not change your IP address/country on the internet, nor does it affect your internet speed. <br><br>\u2022 Some mobile service providers and Internet service providers in certain countries hijack the ability to use specific DNS settings. The Safe Surfer app relies upon this ability. If this is the case in your country with your service provider, the Safe Surfer app may not work properly on your device.",
